## Interfaces

seamless talks to AI products through interfaces that are partly private or undocumented, including Claude
session sockets, Codex `queue` and Desktop IPC, and Grok session files. No code from those products is included
here. The compatibility table in `specs/202610-everyday-use/compat.md` records what was observed and when.
